---
// Benefit — close paraphrase of Mel's answer to question 4:
//   "A hub where a user can just point their agents and get good resources —
//    documentation and feedback, on how to implement or understand a specific
//    tech or topic."
---

<section id="benefit">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <p class="kicker">03 · What you get</p>
      <h2>A hub your agents can read.</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="quote">
      <p>
        A month in, the inbox is no longer a pile of links — it's the
        <strong>source of truth your agents query</strong> before they answer a
        question about a specific tech or topic.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="benefits">
      <div>
        <h3>For your agents</h3>
        <p>
          Entries are tagged, reviewed, and structured. A query like
          <em>"give me the best verified resource on prompt caching"</em> returns a
          handful — not the open web.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>For your community</h3>
        <p>
          Subscribers see the same canon you curated, with your assessment and the
          community's reviews attached. The library compounds with every submission.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>For future you</h3>
        <p>
          Stop re&#8209;researching the same questions. The verification, the tag, and
          the access count already exist — you query, you ship.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .quote {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 0.25rem 0 0.25rem var(--gap-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--gap-4);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .quote p {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--ink);
    max-width: none;
  }
  .quote strong { font-weight: 500; }

  .benefits {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--gap-4);
    margin-top: var(--gap-1);
  }

  .benefits h3::before {
    content: "";
    display: inline-block;
    width: 0.5rem;
    height: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--ember);
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-right: 0.55rem;
    transform: translateY(-0.15rem);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .benefits { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
